{"id":"n82627-1-3","stage":2,"title":"틀림없이 · 无误地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82627-1-3-1","ko":"정말 여기에 서류를 둔 게 맞아?","zh":"真的把文件放在这里了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"서류를","meaning":"文件，材料","explanation":"서류：文件，材料；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"서류","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62870","senseId":"1","lemma":"서류","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"둔","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","explanation":"것：表示对某事的确信或强调。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"5","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맞아?","meaning":"正确，对","explanation":"맞다：正确，对；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"1","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"e90c4f2356666af1","term":"서류","zh":"文件，材料","audio":"/audio/e90c4f2356666af132b3.mp3","entryId":"62870","definition":"用文字记录的文书。","pronunciation":["서류"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对某事的确信或强调。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"正确，对","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"问题的答案没有错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e2c927929ca301edef70.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82627-1-3-2","ko":"그래, 여기에다 틀림없이 내가 넣어 두었다니까.","zh":"对啊，我确实就是放在这儿的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래,","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여기에다","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에다：表示放置、添加或作用的位置；相当于强调的 에。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"틀림없이","meaning":"无误地，没错地，毫无疑问地","explanation":"틀림없이：无误地，没错地，毫无疑问地","readings":[{"term":"틀림없이","audio":"/audio/0927dcd6f9d0950eca6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82627","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀림없이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넣어","meaning":"放进，装进","explanation":"넣다：放进，装进；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"넣다","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64509","senseId":"1","lemma":"넣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"두었다니까.","meaning":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","explanation":"두다：表示前面动作结果的持续进行。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다니까：再次强调已经说过的内容，非敬语：“都说了……”。","readings":[{"term":"두다","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48279","senseId":"1","lemma":"두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"0927dcd6f9d0950e","term":"틀림없이","zh":"无误地，没错地，毫无疑问地","audio":"/audio/0927dcd6f9d0950eca6d.mp3","entryId":"82627","definition":"一点错误或有所违背之处都没有地。","pronunciation":["틀리멉씨"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c0bd6058bd724000","term":"넣다","zh":"放进，装进","audio":"/audio/c0bd6058bd724000a75e.mp3","entryId":"64509","definition":"使进入某个空间里。","pronunciation":["너ː타"]},{"id":"531b2c3977c491e8","term":"두다","zh":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","audio":"/audio/531b2c3977c491e8379e.mp3","entryId":"48279","definition":"表示前面动作结果的持续进行。","pronunciation":["두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/06f8e96cb3515819bb68.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.29,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82627","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":77,"sequenceScore":2.1167,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["真的把文件放在这里了吗？","对啊，我确实就是放在这儿的。","你的脸怎么了？受伤了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["真的把文件放在这里了吗？","对啊，我确实就是放在这儿的。","你的脸怎么了？受伤了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
